&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning change execution:&lt;/strong&gt; You will handle the end to end definition and execution of change through our partners, ensuring any new processes or solutions are actually fit for purpose on the floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrating the teams:&lt;/strong&gt; You will support the domain Director to embed Teleperformance leaders into our existing domain performance review meetings, fostering a one team mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven track record of working closely with or managing global offshore partners and can manage to a customer experience, not just a commercial contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are deeply analytical mindset with the ability to anchor decisions in rigorous data, translating complex metrics into robust business cases that secure senior stakeholder buy in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of leading through others and&amp;nbsp; can influence, coach, and guide Managers who do not report directly to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are brilliant at translating complex business goals into simple steps for frontline teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You zoom out when solving operational problems. Don’t just look at the operational team, always think about how your decisions impact the rest of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything that&#39;s listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £68,400-86,550 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter call (25 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Values &amp;amp; Behaviours Interview (60 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role Specific Interview (60 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
